%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 710e1bac7a011e4d458ef6c347ab4156, type: 3}
  m_Name: Call_MethIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  CallerID: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 09cdebfe05ccaad41adda79be1ca9067, type: 2}
  Stages:
  - Text: You've now got the connections you need to start manufacturing something a bit harder - methamphetamine. Nasty, messy drug, but hella profitable for you.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: Unlike weed, meth doesn't grow on trees, so you're gonna get to get yourself some specialized equipment before you can start cooking.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: Your one-off purchases will be a <h1>chemistry station</h> and a <h1>lab oven</h>. Both can be purchased from Oscar at the warehouse.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: 'For each batch, you''ll need <h1>acid, phosphorus</h> and <h1>pseudo.</h> The first two are easy enough to come by and can be purchased from Oscar, but you''ll need to talk to <h1>Shirley</h> for the pseudo. '
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: Once you've got all those supplies, you'll be ready to start cookin' up a batch.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers:
    - Conditions:
        EvaluationType: 0
        ConditionList: []
        QuestConditionList: []
      onEvaluateTrueVariableSetters: []
      onEvaluateTrueQuestSetters:
      - QuestName: We Need To Cook
        SetQuestState: 0
        QuestState: 0
        SetQuestEntryState: 1
        QuestEntryIndex: 0
        QuestEntryState: 2
      onEvaluateTrue:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      onEvaluateFalseVariableSetters: []
      onEvaluateFalseQuestSetters: []
      onEvaluateFalse:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
  onCallCompleted:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
